{
  "title": "NAT Gateway · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "프라이빗 Subnet 자원이 외부로 시작한 연결의 IPv4 통신을 돕는다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>NAT <span class=\"full-name\">(Network Address Translation)</span> Gateway</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#public-nat-gateway\">Public NAT Gateway</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#private-nat-gateway\">Private NAT Gateway</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#zonal-nat-gateway\">Zonal NAT Gateway</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#regional-nat-gateway\">Regional NAT Gateway</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#dns64-and-nat64\">DNS64 and NAT64</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#nat-instance\">NAT Instance</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#cost-and-service-endpoints\">Cost and Service Endpoints</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>네트워크</span><span>33 / 62</span></div><h1>NAT <span class=\"full-name\">(Network Address Translation)</span> Gateway</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 7 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>NAT <span class=\"full-name\">(Network Address Translation)</span> Gateway는 내부 리소스가 시작한 연결의 주소·포트를 변환해 외부 서비스와 통신하게 한다. 외부가 먼저 Private <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>에 연결하는 공개 진입점으로 사용하는 서비스가 아니다.</p><p>Connectivity Type의 Public·Private과 Availability Mode의 Zonal·Regional은 서로 다른 분류다. 현재 문서는 여러 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>로 자동 확장되는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#regional-nat-gateway\">Regional NAT Gateway</a>도 제공하므로 모든 NAT <span class=\"full-name\">(Network Address Translation)</span>를 단일 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>로만 설명하면 부정확하다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"NAT의 연결 목적과 배포 범위\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>NAT의 연결 목적과 배포 범위</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Connectivity type</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Private workload</strong><small>외부로 연결 시작</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#public-nat-gateway\">Public NAT Gateway</a> → <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">IGW</a></strong><small>Public IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span> 인터넷 경로</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Internet</strong><small>응답만 기존 연결로 반환</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Availability mode</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#zonal-nat-gateway\">Zonal NAT Gateway</a></strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>별 경로·장애 대응 설계</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#regional-nat-gateway\">Regional NAT Gateway</a></strong><small>필요 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>로 자동 확장</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Route planning</strong><small>서로 다른 배포 모델 확인</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\"><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#private-nat-gateway\">Private NAT Gateway</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">IGW</a>를 통한 인터넷 출구가 아니다. Zonal·Regional은 별도의 배포 축이다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"public-nat-gateway\"><h2>Public NAT <span class=\"full-name\">(Network Address Translation)</span> Gateway<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#public-nat-gateway\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>일반적인 Zonal Public NAT <span class=\"full-name\">(Network Address Translation)</span>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/#public-subnet\">Public Subnet</a>에 만들고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/\">Elastic IP</a>를 연결한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/#private-subnet\">Private Subnet</a>은 NAT <span class=\"full-name\">(Network Address Translation)</span>로, NAT <span class=\"full-name\">(Network Address Translation)</span> Subnet은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">Internet Gateway</a>로 Route를 가진다. 인터넷 서버에서는 NAT <span class=\"full-name\">(Network Address Translation)</span>의 Public Address를 요청 출발지로 보게 된다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"private-nat-gateway\"><h2>Private NAT <span class=\"full-name\">(Network Address Translation)</span> Gateway<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#private-nat-gateway\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> 또는 On-premises와의 사설 통신에서 주소 변환에 사용하며 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/\">Elastic IP</a>를 연결하지 않는다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">Transit Gateway</a>나 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#customer-gateway-and-virtual-private-gateway\">Virtual Private Gateway</a>를 통해 전송할 수 있다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">Internet Gateway</a>로 인터넷 통신을 보내는 용도로 쓰면 해당 트래픽이 전달되지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"zonal-nat-gateway\"><h2>Zonal NAT <span class=\"full-name\">(Network Address Translation)</span> Gateway<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#zonal-nat-gateway\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>하나의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>에서 동작하는 방식이다. 여러 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>에서 장애 격리와 교차 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 전송 비용을 줄이려면 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>별 NAT <span class=\"full-name\">(Network Address Translation)</span>와 해당 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 Route를 구성한다. 다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> NAT <span class=\"full-name\">(Network Address Translation)</span> 하나를 공유하는 설계는 비용·장애 경계를 함께 고려해야 한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"regional-nat-gateway\"><h2>Regional NAT <span class=\"full-name\">(Network Address Translation)</span> Gateway<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#regional-nat-gateway\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p>단일 NAT <span class=\"full-name\">(Network Address Translation)</span> ID <span class=\"full-name\">(Identifier)</span>로 여러 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 Workload를 지원하고 사용 위치에 따라 확장한다. 호스팅할 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/#public-subnet\">Public Subnet</a>을 직접 만들 필요가 없으며 전용 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a>을 가진다. 기존 Zonal 설계와 생성·Route 설정이 다르다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"dns64-and-nat64\"><h2>DNS64 and NAT64<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#dns64-and-nat64\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>IPv6 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 6)</span> 전용 리소스에서 IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span> 목적지에 접근할 때 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#dns64-and-nat64\">DNS64</a>가 합성 주소를 제공하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#dns64-and-nat64\">NAT64</a>가 프로토콜 주소 변환을 수행한다. IPv6 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 6)</span> 목적지로 Outbound만 할 때는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/#egress-only-internet-gateway\">Egress-only Internet Gateway</a>도 비교한다. 주소 유형과 목적지 지원에 맞게 고른다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"nat-instance\"><h2>NAT <span class=\"full-name\">(Network Address Translation)</span> Instance<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#nat-instance\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>를 직접 Router·NAT <span class=\"full-name\">(Network Address Translation)</span>로 운영하는 대안이다. OS 패치, 용량, Failover와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#source-destination-check\">Source/Destination Check</a> 설정을 사용자가 관리한다. 일반적인 관리 부담 최소화 요구에는 NAT <span class=\"full-name\">(Network Address Translation)</span> Gateway가 맞는 경우가 많다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"cost-and-service-endpoints\"><h2>Cost and Service Endpoints<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#cost-and-service-endpoints\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>NAT <span class=\"full-name\">(Network Address Translation)</span>에는 사용 시간과 데이터 처리 등의 비용이 있다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/\">DynamoDB</a> 접근은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#gateway-endpoint\">Gateway Endpoint</a>로 보내 NAT <span class=\"full-name\">(Network Address Translation)</span> 경유를 줄일 수 있다. 비용 최적화 시 처리량뿐 아니라 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 간 전송도 함께 계산한다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>Private <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>가 패키지 저장소에는 NAT <span class=\"full-name\">(Network Address Translation)</span>로 접근하되 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>에는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#gateway-endpoint\">Gateway Endpoint</a>를 사용하면 인터넷 Outbound와 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> 서비스 Private 접근 경로를 분리할 수 있다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>인터넷이 NAT <span class=\"full-name\">(Network Address Translation)</span>를 거쳐 프라이빗 인스턴스에 연결을 먼저 시작하는 용도가 아니다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/vpc/latest/userguide/vpc-nat-gateway.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">vpc/latest/userguide/vpc-nat-gateway.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/vpc/latest/userguide/nat-gateways-regional.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">vpc/latest/userguide/nat-gateways-regional.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q010/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q010\" data-question=\"Q010\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q010</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q010/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance in a private subnet needs outbound IPv4 access to an internet package repository. What is a typical design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q010\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A NAT gateway in a public subnet and a route from the private subnet to it</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q010\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Attach an internet gateway directly to the private subnet</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q010\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Deploy only CloudFront</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q010\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Use a Route 53 failover policy</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · 퍼블릭 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a>를 통해 외부 연결을 시작하고 응답받는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">Internet Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q011\" data-question=\"Q011\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q011</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q011/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An application runs in two Availability Zones and uses zonal public NAT gateways. If one AZ fails, workloads in the surviving AZ must retain outbound internet access. Which NAT design should the architect use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q011\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Add only a network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q011\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Use a single NAT gateway in AZ A</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q011\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Deploy a NAT gateway in each AZ and route each subnet to its local NAT gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q011\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Attach one Elastic IP to both AZs simultaneously</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>별 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a>와 경로는 단일 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a> 의존을 제거하고 교차 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 트래픽도 줄인다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q017\" data-question=\"Q017\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q017</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q017/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A private EC2 instance needs access to S3 without routing S3 traffic through a NAT gateway. What is usually the simplest choice?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q017\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A public Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q017\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">VPC peering</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q017\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An S3 gateway VPC endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q017\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An Application Load Balancer</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 게이트웨이 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">라우트 테이블</a>을 통해 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>로 사설 경로를 제공한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">VPC Endpoint</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q081\" data-question=\"Q081\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q081</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q081/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs to analyze whether NAT gateways or data transfer caused a cost increase over time. Which tool is appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q081\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An SCP</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q081\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A Network Load Balancer</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q081\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Cost Explorer</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q081\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">SQS visibility timeout</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#aws-cost-explorer\">Cost Explorer</a>로 서비스와 기간별 비용 추세를 분석한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/\">Budgets / Cost Explorer</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q083\" data-question=\"Q083\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0,3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q083</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q083/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance in a private subnet needs to access only S3. Which TWO components reduce NAT usage and internet exposure?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q083\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Configure the subnet&#x27;s route table</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q083\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Assign an Elastic IP address to the EC2 instance</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q083\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Require a default route to an internet gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q083\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Create an S3 gateway VPC endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q083\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">Allow inbound access from 0.0.0.0/0</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, D</strong> · 게이트웨이 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>와 적절한 라우트 연결을 사용한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 접근에 공인 주소나 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">IGW</a>가 필수는 아니다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">VPC Endpoint</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">이전 용어 <b>Lambda</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">다음 용어 <b>Network ACL</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
